<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Harbor Therapy — Compassionate Online Therapy Services</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Harbor Therapy offers licensed online therapy, personalized care plans, and flexible scheduling to support your mental health journey."
    />
    <link
      rel="preconnect"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"
    />
    <link
      rel="preconnect"
      href="https://fonts.gstatic.com"
      crossorigin
    />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --color-background: #f6f7fb;
        --color-primary: #4b70dd;
        --color-primary-dark: #3652a9;
        --color-secondary: #86c5be;
        --color-text: #1f2a44;
        --color-muted: #6c7792;
        --color-card-bg: #ffffff;
        --shadow-soft: 0 18px 40px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.08);
        --radius-lg: 24px;
        --radius-md: 18px;
        --radius-sm: 12px;
        --max-width: 1200px;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Manrope", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
          sans-serif;
        color: var(--color-text);
        background: var(--color-background);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3,
      h4 {
        font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.2;
        color: var(--color-text);
      }

      p {
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
      }

      button,
      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 600;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .btn-primary {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-secondary));
        color: white;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.25);
      }

      .btn-primary:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(54, 82, 169, 0.35);
      }

      .btn-outline {
        border: 1.5px solid rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.35);
        background: white;
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      .btn-outline:hover {
        border-color: var(--color-primary);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.15);
      }

      header {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 10;
        background: rgba(246, 247, 251, 0.94);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(108, 119, 146, 0.06);
      }

      .nav {
        margin: 0 auto;
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }

      .logo {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      .logo-badge {
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-secondary));
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      nav ul {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }

      nav a:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      .nav-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .hero {
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 4rem auto 0;
        padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 3rem;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }

      .hero-eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.12);
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      .hero-bullets {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.8rem;
      }

      .hero-bullets span {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .hero-bullets span::before {
        content: "●";
        color: var(--color-secondary);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }

      .hero-cta {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1rem;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .hero-image {
        position: relative;
        padding: 2.5rem;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.18), transparent 55%);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        min-height: 420px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
      }

      .hero-card {
        width: min(370px, 100%);
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        padding: 2.2rem;
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .hero-card h3 {
        font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }

      .hero-availability {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }

      .hero-availability strong {
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      .hero-card .stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .stat-card {
        background: rgba(134, 197, 190, 0.12);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        padding: 1rem;
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.3rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }

      .stat-card strong {
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      .trust-bar {
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 1.5rem 3rem;
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .trust-bar p {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
        text-align: center;
      }

      .trust-logos {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 1.5rem 2.5rem;
        color: rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.45);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      section {
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 1.5rem 5rem;
      }

      .section-heading {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
      }

      .section-heading h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .section-heading p {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .services-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 1.8rem;
      }

      .service-card {
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 2rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .service-icon {
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.12);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
      }

      .service-card h3 {
        font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
      }

      .service-card ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 1rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.4rem;
      }

      .approach {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.08), rgba(134, 197, 190, 0.12));
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 3rem 3.5rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 3rem;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .approach-steps {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.4rem;
      }

      .step {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.4rem;
      }

      .step-heading {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      .step-number {
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: white;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.12);
      }

      .therapist-card {
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 2rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .therapist-card img {
        width: 110px;
        height: 110px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 50%;
        margin: 0 auto;
        border: 4px solid rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.24);
      }

      .therapist-card .credentials {
        display: inline-flex;
        background: rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.12);
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }

      .metrics {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 3rem;
      }

      .metric-card {
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 1.6rem;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      }

      .metric-card strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 2rem;
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      .testimonials {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 1.8rem;
      }

      .testimonial-card {
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 2rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.2rem;
      }

      .testimonial-rating {
        color: #f5b452;
        letter-spacing: 0.2rem;
      }

      .testimonial-author {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.15rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      .plans {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 1.8rem;
      }

      .plan-card {
        background: white;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 2.3rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.2rem;
        border: 1.5px solid transparent;
      }

      .plan-card.popular {
        border-color: rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.35);
        transform: translateY(-10px);
      }

      .plan-price {
        font-size: 2.6rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      .plan-features {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 1rem;
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }

      .faq-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }

      details {
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.06);
      }

      summary {
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: var(--color-text);
        list-style: none;
      }

      summary::marker {
        display: none;
      }

      summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
      }

      details[open] summary {
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      details p {
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
      }

      .cta-banner {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-secondary));
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 3rem 3.5rem;
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.2rem;
        text-align: center;
        color: white;
        box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.25);
      }

      .cta-banner h2 {
        color: inherit;
        font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
      }

      .cta-banner p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      }

      .cta-actions {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 1.2rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .cta-actions .btn {
        background: white;
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      .cta-actions .btn-outline {
        background: transparent;
        color: white;
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      }

      .contact-section {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 2.4rem;
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 3rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      }

      .contact-section form {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.2rem;
      }

      label {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-text);
      }

      input,
      select,
      textarea {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
        border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
        border: 1.5px solid rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.1);
        font-family: inherit;
        font-size: 1rem;
        background: rgba(246, 247, 251, 0.7);
        transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      }

      input:focus,
      select:focus,
      textarea:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: var(--color-primary);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(75, 112, 221, 0.15);
      }

      textarea {
        min-height: 140px;
        resize: vertical;
      }

      footer {
        margin-top: 5rem;
        background: #111827;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      }

      .footer-content {
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 2.5rem;
      }

      .footer-brand h3 {
        font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
        color: white;
        margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      }

      .footer-links,
      .footer-contact {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.6rem;
      }

      .footer-links a {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      }

      .footer-links a:hover {
        color: white;
      }

      .footer-bottom {
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      }

      .mobile-nav-toggle {
        display: none;
        background: none;
        border: none;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      }

      @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .hero {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-bullets span {
          justify-content: center;
        }

        .hero-cta {
          justify-content: center;
        }

        .services-grid,
        .testimonials,
        .plans {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }

        .approach {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          text-align: center;
        }

        .approach-steps {
          text-align: left;
        }

        .metrics {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }

        .contact-section {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .footer-content {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        header {
          position: static;
        }

        .nav {
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          gap: 1rem;
        }

        nav ul {
          display: none;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 1rem;
          width: 100%;
          background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
          padding: 1rem;
          border-radius: var(--radius-md);
          box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.14);
        }

        nav ul.active {
          display: flex;
        }

        .nav-actions {
          width: 100%;
          justify-content: flex-start;
        }

        .mobile-nav-toggle {
          display: inline-flex;
          align-items: center;
        }

        .services-grid,
        .testimonials,
        .plans {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .faq-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .footer-content {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          text-align: center;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="nav">
        <a class="logo" href="#top">
          <span class="logo-badge">H</span>
          Harbor Therapy
        </a>
        <button class="mobile-nav-toggle" id="mobileNavToggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="primaryNav">
          ☰
        </button>
        <nav>
          <ul id="primaryNav">
            <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
            <li><a href="#approach">Our Approach</a></li>
            <li><a href="#testimonials">Stories</a></li>
            <li><a href="#pricing">Plans</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
        <div class="nav-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#contact">Free Consultation</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero" id="top">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="hero-eyebrow">Licensed online therapy • Compassionate care</span>
          <h1>Find calm, clarity, and support with personalized therapy.</h1>
          <p>
            Whether you’re navigating anxiety, burnout, or life transitions, Harbor Therapy
            pairs you with a licensed therapist who understands your story and supports your
            growth with science-backed strategies.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-bullets">
            <span>Flexible scheduling including evenings and weekends</span>
            <span>Individual, couples, and group therapy options</span>
            <span>Confidential, HIPAA-compliant sessions</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">Book a discovery call</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#services">Explore services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="hero-card">
            <div>
              <h3>Therapists available this week</h3>
              <div class="hero-availability">
                <span><strong>24</strong> openings for new clients</span>
                <span><strong>48h</strong> average wait time</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stats">
              <div class="stat-card">
                <strong>92%</strong>
                report reduced anxiety
              </div>
              <div class="stat-card">
                <strong>4.9★</strong>
                client satisfaction
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p>“I finally feel heard and supported. Every session gives me tools I can use.”</p>
              <strong>— Maya, client since 2023</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="trust-bar">
        <p>Trusted by clients from</p>
        <div class="trust-logos">
          <span>Forbes Health</span>
          <span>Mindful Living</span>
          <span>Calm Space Collective</span>
          <span>RemoteWell Network</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section id="services">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Therapy services tailored to support your journey</h2>
          <p>
            Explore specialized care designed around your needs. From immediate relief to long-term
            growth, our therapists partner with you every step of the way.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-grid">
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌿</div>
            <h3>Individual Therapy</h3>
            <p>
              Personalized one-on-one sessions focused on anxiety, depression, stress management,
              and life transitions.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Evidence-based CBT, ACT, and mindfulness</li>
              <li>Weekly or bi-weekly 50-minute sessions</li>
              <li>Goal tracking dashboard</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">🤝</div>
            <h3>Couples Counseling</h3>
            <p>
              Rebuild trust, improve communication, and create a shared path toward a meaningful
              relationship.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Licensed couples therapists</li>
              <li>Conflict transformation strategies</li>
              <li>Flexible 75-minute sessions</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌅</div>
            <h3>Group Programs</h3>
            <p>
              Guided small-group sessions focused on burnout recovery, grief support, and mindful
              leadership.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>6–8 participants max</li>
              <li>Structured curriculum with take-home exercises</li>
              <li>Peer accountability and community</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="approach">
        <div class="approach">
          <div>
            <div class="section-heading">
              <h2>You deserve tailored, evidence-based care</h2>
              <p>
                Harbor therapists blend clinical expertise with genuine empathy. Our collaborative
                approach ensures each session adapts to your pace, priorities, and progress.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="approach-steps">
